Table full name: US_ADDRESSES__POI.CYBERSYN.CYBERSYN_DATA_CATALOG
Column name: DATA_SOURCE Type: ARRAY Description: Source of the data.
Column name: LICENSE_URL Type: ARRAY Description: Array of URLs that provide the licensing for the data sources in this table.
Column name: CREATED_DATE Type: DATE Description: Date for the table's addition to the Snowflake Marketplace.
Column name: LISTING_NAME Type: ARRAY Description: Human-readable name of listing(s) associated with table.
Column name: TABLE_NAME_PROPER Type: TEXT Description: Human-readable table name.
Column name: LAST_UPDATED_TIMESTAMP Type: TIMESTAMP_TZ Description: Timestamp for the table's last update or modification.
Column name: DESCRIPTION Type: TEXT Description: Details on the source of the data, the table, and what is included in the table.
Column name: TABLE_TYPE Type: TEXT Description: Cybersyn table type as part of the unified schema.
Column name: SELECT_RELATED_TABLES Type: ARRAY Description: Array of tables that you can join based on the entity and variable relationships; not an exhaustive list.
